    "description": "Dunhill\nDesktop Cigar Humidor - Polished Hardwood\nVintage Era, Brass Hardware & Humidifier Tubes\nCrafted by British luxury house Alfred Dunhill, this vintage desktop cigar humidor showcases exceptional woodworking and specialized design. Engineered to maintain proper tobacco moisture, the box features perimeter ventilation vents, heavy brass stay hinges, and an interior side rack for humidification tubes. The interior lid displays an inlaid Dunhill plaque alongside a square brass bracket fixture.\nWarm-toned polished wood exterior with fine visible grain\nInterior compartment with slotted vents and removable divider\nTwo cylindrical humidification tubes with brass vented caps\nMeasures approximately 11\" long by 9\" high by 4.5\" wide\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition overall. Wood casing shows light surface marks and edge wear consistent with age. Brass hardware and hinges are firmly anchored and function smoothly. Key is not included. Humidifier tubes show interior residue from previous use.",
